%% DevSecOps pipeline: security gates woven through build-to-deploy
flowchart LR
    push[git push] --> build[Build & Test<br/>mvn verify · GATE]
    build --> secrets[Secret Scan<br/>gitleaks · GATE]
    secrets --> scans

    subgraph scans["Security Scans (report-only, parallel)"]
        direction TB
        sast[SAST<br/>Semgrep]
        deps[Dependencies + FS<br/>Trivy]
        iac[IaC<br/>Checkov]
    end

    scans --> image[Build Image<br/>multi-stage, non-root]
    image --> imgscan[Image Scan + SBOM<br/>Trivy · Syft]
    imgscan --> deploy[Deploy]
    deploy --> smoke[Smoke Test<br/>curl /health]

    classDef gate fill:#fde2e1,stroke:#d33,color:#111;
    class build,secrets gate;
